        "text": "price-threshold-alert (ATH / ±20% 1h / operator targets, */30 min, 4h dedup per gate) closes the window between calm-daily token-report and event-driven signal. fork-release-tracker (Sunday 19:30 UTC) answers \"did any fork ship a tagged release this week?\" — pairs with fork-cohort's 19:00 UTC \"is the fork alive?\" scan. With today's ATH at $0.0000331, the price-alert ATH gate would have fired had it been enabled.",
