      "type": "Text",
      "props": {
        "text": "auto-merge-agent-prs (daily 18:00 UTC, 9 eligibility gates incl. author=aeonframework + branch-name discipline + retry cap, gh pr merge --squash --auto) removes the operator click on every agent-authored PR. thread-formatter backport (9-signal scoring, threshold 3, 5-tweet 280-char structure) pre-builds the paste-block when a high-signal event lands. Same-day-after backport pattern now caught up — only v4-readiness remains.",
