        "text": "github-actions column (CI run visibility — workflow + branch filter, status pill across 9 terminal conclusions + in-flight) closes minitor's last big repo-health gap. npm column (keyless registry search + weekly-downloads badge, 4 sort modes heavy-weighted 0.8/0.1/0.1) fills the package-discovery surface — the canonical TypeScript discovery layer for minitor's audience. Two-day plugin sprint (39 → 41) is the largest in the project's history.",
